abstract: Fourteen multilingual, offline-ready interactive AI labs spanning foundational mechanisms and modern extensions. v1.5 adds a mechanism-faithful engagement-excellence layer for Transformer state continuity and deterministic continuation, agent runtime gates and an isolated simulated sandbox, DPLL branch/prune search structure, and exact Bayesian posterior before/after comparison while preserving the ten already-strong applets without decorative changes.